.TH CTHRPOOL_FUTURE_DONE 3 "2026-08-02" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Functions"
.SH NAME
cthrpool_future_done \- non-blocking check for future completion
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ccollections/cthreadpool.h>

bool cthrpool_future_done(cthrpool_future_t *f);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Tells you, without blocking, whether the task of the future has
finished (or was cancelled). It returns false while the task is still
pending or running.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
f   Future handle (NULL returns false)
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
true if the future has a result or was cancelled, false otherwise.
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cthrpool_future_get (3),
.BR cthrpool_future_cancelled (3)
